---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — CC3PO">
  <section class="section legal-page" style="padding-top:120px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you use our HIPAA Scanner or submit a lead form, we collect: your name, email, phone number, company/practice name, and the URL you submit for scanning. We also collect standard web analytics data (page views, browser type, IP address).</p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to: provide the HIPAA compliance scan and report, follow up on your inquiry, improve our services, and send relevant product updates. We will never sell your personal data to third parties.</p>

      <h2>3. HIPAA Compliance Data</h2>
      <p>Scan results are encrypted in transit and at rest. We do not store Protected Health Information (PHI) through our scanner. You own all data generated by your scan. We retain scan results for 90 days, after which they are permanently deleted.</p>

      <h2>4. SMS Communications</h2>
      <p>By opting in to SMS, you consent to receive text messages from CC3PO LLC. Message frequency varies. Reply STOP to cancel at any time. Msg & data rates may apply. We will not send promotional SMS without your explicit opt-in.</p>

      <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Lead form submissions are retained for 12 months. Scan results are retained for 90 days. You may request deletion of your data at any time by contacting us.</p>

      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to: access your personal data, request correction or deletion, opt out of communications, and request a copy of your data. Contact us at any time to exercise these rights.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>CC3PO LLC<br />For privacy inquiries, contact us via our <a href="https://cc3po.io/strategy-call">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .legal-updated {
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-sm);
  }
  .legal-page p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: color var(--duration-fast);
  }
  .legal-page a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
  }
</style>